          "id": "12890276",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shyrkov",
            "name": "shyrkov",
            "key": "shyrkov",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=shyrkov&avatarId=37823",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=shyrkov&avatarId=37823",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=shyrkov&avatarId=37823",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=shyrkov&avatarId=37823"
            },
            "displayName": "Sergiy Shyrkov",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "Hello Claus,\n\nthere is a small issue with the committed patch (I used in on my Jackrabbit 1.x deployment).\nThe output is as follows:\n\n2010-07-20 16:39:08,367: ERROR [OnWorkspaceInconsistency] - Node [Ljava.lang.Object;@18f238fc. Please run a consistency check on this workspace! ({}) has missing child '{}' ({})\n\nIn the code you are concatenating the arguments object array with a string:\n\n   log.error(\"Node {} ({}) has missing child '{}' ({})\", new Object[]{...} + \". Please run a consistency check on this workspace!\");\n\nso it results in replacing only the first argument.\n\nI guess, you intention was to do:\n\n   log.error(\"Node {} ({}) has missing child '{}' ({}). Please run a consistency check on this workspace!\", new Object[]{...});\n\ninstead.\n\nKind regards\nSergiy",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shyrkov",
            "name": "shyrkov",
            "key": "shyrkov",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=shyrkov&avatarId=37823",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=shyrkov&avatarId=37823",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=shyrkov&avatarId=37823",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=shyrkov&avatarId=37823"
            },
            "displayName": "Sergiy Shyrkov",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2010-07-20T15:09:40.291+0000",
          "updated": "2010-07-20T15:09:40.291+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12466550/comment/12890557",
          "id": "12890557",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=c_koell",
            "name": "c_koell",
            "key": "c_koell",
            "avatarUrls": {
